{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/mayas-geneva-sama-ezdan-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":503,"crm_id":"323","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Mayas Geneva","slug":"mayas-geneva-sama-ezdan-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment","commerce"],"completion_year":"2023","developer":"Sama Ezdan","price":1318750,"display_price":"1.318M","lattitude":25.0543932,"longitude":55.2023208,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Mayas Geneva - a luxury 5-storey project by developer Sama Ezdan, located in one of Dubai's fastest growing neighbourhoods - JVC. One of the main features of the complex is its unique architecture, combining traditional Middle Eastern style and modern elements. The project features elegant <strong>studios, 1-3 bedroom apartments and two-bedroom duplexes.</strong> The interiors are finished with high quality materials and each residence is designed with a comfortable and functional living environment.</p><p>Mayas Geneva offers its residents a wide range of amenities, including a state-of-the-art gym, swimming pool with sun loungers, and a picturesque park at the foot of the complex with a variety of recreational areas, walking paths and barbecue facilities.</p><p>JVC has a well-developed infrastructure, so residents can find cafes, restaurants, shops, supermarkets, medical centres and educational institutions within walking distance from the complex. Circle Mall is 10 minutes away, Palm Jumeirah and Dubai Marina are 15 minutes away, and Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are approximately 25 minutes away.</p><p>Mayas Geneva is an ideal location for those looking for modern accommodation in a vibrant neighbourhood in Dubai. The project offers a high level of quality of life and standards of comfort suitable for the most discerning residents.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/323/images/2024/04/15/HsQt8WqsoUycJ2W6p80dekN36wco6NfHoVKjcRJ0.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/15/HsQt8WqsoUycJ2W6p80dekN36wco6NfHoVKjcRJ0.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/323/images/2024/04/15/l1Bc9FvtxlFqERiOB2M77DWYDVRn9duXN9Yiyojy.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/15/l1Bc9FvtxlFqERiOB2M77DWYDVRn9duXN9Yiyojy.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/323/images/2024/04/15/OBGTiJQMfkVpXLBXaIitZJDabFdNgaqp25TBkfil.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/15/OBGTiJQMfkVpXLBXaIitZJDabFdNgaqp25TBkfil.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/323/images/2024/04/15/KocR7dgwNcYlhXDg503uRQvumV1hlTwhTqdAA2DI.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/15/KocR7dgwNcYlhXDg503uRQvumV1hlTwhTqdAA2DI.png","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":1963,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1215,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":2168,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2169,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2170,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2171,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 bedroom duplex","kitchen":null,"parking":nul